    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross and Gun</strong> is a game where you investigate supernatural phenomena in a house and fight demons with a cross and a gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828730/extras/c5ae039b349ba1043b96dc96541a1a2a.poster.avif?t=1752154696\" width=400 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828730/extras/c5ae039b349ba1043b96dc96541a1a2a.webm?t=1752154696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828730/extras/c5ae039b349ba1043b96dc96541a1a2a.mp4?t=1752154696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been assigned to exorcise a house known for strange occurrences. Find the anomalies and eliminate the hidden demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail to uncover the anomalies, the forces of evil will grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828730/extras/06a51e1bcea6320f406ea2ae0b87169e.poster.avif?t=1752154696\" width=400 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828730/extras/06a51e1bcea6320f406ea2ae0b87169e.webm?t=1752154696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828730/extras/06a51e1bcea6320f406ea2ae0b87169e.mp4?t=1752154696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some demons will face you head-on. You must deliver judgment as God\u2019s right and left hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block, dodge, strike, stab, and shoot\u2014defeat the demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate all demons behind the anomalies. Drive <strong>&quot;faith&quot;</strong> into the heads of the defiant ones.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross and Gun</strong> is a game where you investigate supernatural phenomena in a house and fight demons with a cross and a gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828730/extras/c5ae039b349ba1043b96dc96541a1a2a.poster.avif?t=1752154696\" width=400 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828730/extras/c5ae039b349ba1043b96dc96541a1a2a.webm?t=1752154696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828730/extras/c5ae039b349ba1043b96dc96541a1a2a.mp4?t=1752154696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been assigned to exorcise a house known for strange occurrences. Find the anomalies and eliminate the hidden demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail to uncover the anomalies, the forces of evil will grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828730/extras/06a51e1bcea6320f406ea2ae0b87169e.poster.avif?t=1752154696\" width=400 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828730/extras/06a51e1bcea6320f406ea2ae0b87169e.webm?t=1752154696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828730/extras/06a51e1bcea6320f406ea2ae0b87169e.mp4?t=1752154696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some demons will face you head-on. You must deliver judgment as God\u2019s right and left hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block, dodge, strike, stab, and shoot\u2014defeat the demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate all demons behind the anomalies. Drive <strong>&quot;faith&quot;</strong> into the heads of the defiant ones.</p>",
